{
    "title": "Weather Radar by WeatherBug",
    "description": "Get reliable weather forecasts with WeatherBug! With over 20 map layers, including Radar and Severe Storm Risk, WeatherBug provides comprehensive weather insights to help keep you safe. From real-time lightning to real-time precipitation, WeatherBug ensures you are always informed. Stay updated with customizable weather alerts, hourly and 10-day Forecasts, and Hurricane Outlooks.\r\n\r\nTrusted since 2000, WeatherBug ensures you're always prepared with reliable weather data. Join millions of users and Know Before\u00ae severe weather strikes with one of the most comprehensive Weather Apps in the Industry. \r\n\r\n\r\nTHE WEATHERBUG ADVANTAGE\r\n\u2022 Spark\u2122 Lightning with real-time lightning information near you\r\n\u2022 Outdoor Sports Section with Disney Weather Check\u2019s world-class weather safety standards\r\n\u2022 Air You Breathe Section with Air quality information, including top allergy triggers around you\r\n\u2022 Hurricane Tracker with a 7-day Outlook for the Tropics\r\n\u2022 Extensive weather observation networks and unique severe weather detection\r\n\u2022 Over 20 Weather map Layers\r\n\u2022 Ad-Free Subscription Options Available!\r\n \r\nWEATHER ALERTS\r\n \u2022 Get Severe Weather Alerts from WeatherBug, NWS & NOAA (USA), NMS (UK and DE), and SMN (MX)\r\n\u2022 Weather Notifications: Receive alerts for your preferred locations\r\n\u2022 Manage Alerts according to your location and preferences:\r\n\r\n1. Weather Alerts: Get notified when severe weather alerts have been issued\r\n2. Lightning: Get notified when lightning strikes close to your location\r\n3. Real-Time Precipitation: Get notified when rain/snow is expected within 15 min.\r\n4. Daily Precipitation: Get notified when rain or snow is expected in the next 24 hours\r\n5. Severe Storm Risk: Get notified when there is an increased risk of storms.\r\n6. Commuter: Get notified when the weather might impact road conditions \r\n7. Pollen: Get notified when pollen levels are medium or high\r\n8. Air Quality: Get notified when the air quality index is low \r\n9. Hurricane Tracker: Get informed about hurricane activity and warnings \r\n10. Trending News: Get notified about current news, user videos, safety tips, and more!\r\n\r\nAIR QUALITY, HEAT, WILDFIRES\r\n\u2022 Get UV Index information, wind speeds, weather observations \r\n\u2022 Global wildfire data to know when you are at risk\r\n\u2022 Air quality with an in-depth look at the air quality around you\r\n\u2022 Pollen count:  Locally and nationally \r\n \r\nWEATHER CUSTOMIZATION\r\n\u2022 Weather Widgets: Add weather information to your home screen \r\n\u2022 Temperature Units:  Fahrenheit (\u00b0F) and Celsius (\u00b0C)\r\n\u2022 Wind Units: MPH, KPH, Knots & MPS\r\n\u2022 Pressure Units: Inches & millibars\r\n \r\nCOMMUTER\r\n\u2022 Road Forecast:  Know when weather conditions will impact your commute with access to live road conditions\r\n\u2022 Weather Cameras: View live weather cameras for your commute\r\n\u2022 Traffic Cameras: Access live traffic cameras along your route\r\n\u2022 Commuter Alerts: Be alerted when weather impacts road conditions\r\n \r\n RADAR WEATHER MAPS\r\n\u2022 Weather Map: Explore weather conditions, temperature, pollen levels & and more with Doppler radar & and interactive maps\r\n\u2022 Severe Storm Risk: Know when convective weather is expected to hit. Storm radar shows severe storms, tornados, hail, high winds\r\n\r\n\r\nCONNECT WITH US  \r\n\u2022 Facebook: @WeatherBug\r\n\u2022 X: @WeatherBug\r\n\u2022 Instagram: @weatherbug\r\n\u2022 TikTok: @officialweatherbug\r\n\r\n \r\nThis app may include \"Interest-Based Ads\" (https://www.weatherbug.com/legal/privacy) for more information) and may collect or share \"Precise Location Data\" (https://www.weatherbug.com/legal/privacy for more information)",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get reliable weather forecasts with WeatherBug! With over 20 map layers, including Radar and Severe Storm Risk, WeatherBug provides comprehensive weather insights to help keep you safe. From real-time lightning to real-time precipitation, WeatherBug ensures you are always informed. Stay updated with customizable weather alerts, hourly and 10-day Forecasts, and Hurricane Outlooks.<br><br>Trusted since 2000, WeatherBug ensures you&#39;re always prepared with reliable weather data. Join millions of users and Know Before\u00ae severe weather strikes with one of the most comprehensive Weather Apps in the Industry. <br><br><br>THE WEATHERBUG ADVANTAGE<br>\u2022 Spark\u2122 Lightning with real-time lightning information near you<br>\u2022 Outdoor Sports Section with Disney Weather Check\u2019s world-class weather safety standards<br>\u2022 Air You Breathe Section with Air quality information, including top allergy triggers around you<br>\u2022 Hurricane Tracker with a 7-day Outlook for the Tropics<br>\u2022 Extensive weather observation networks and unique severe weather detection<br>\u2022 Over 20 Weather map Layers<br>\u2022 Ad-Free Subscription Options Available!<br> <br>WEATHER ALERTS<br> \u2022 Get Severe Weather Alerts from WeatherBug, NWS &amp; NOAA (USA), NMS (UK and DE), and SMN (MX)<br>\u2022 Weather Notifications: Receive alerts for your preferred locations<br>\u2022 Manage Alerts according to your location and preferences:<br><br>1. Weather Alerts: Get notified when severe weather alerts have been issued<br>2. Lightning: Get notified when lightning strikes close to your location<br>3. Real-Time Precipitation: Get notified when rain/snow is expected within 15 min.<br>4. Daily Precipitation: Get notified when rain or snow is expected in the next 24 hours<br>5. Severe Storm Risk: Get notified when there is an increased risk of storms.<br>6. Commuter: Get notified when the weather might impact road conditions <br>7. Pollen: Get notified when